213
00:08:08,425 --> 00:08:10,494
Pass or fail. You need all five.

214
00:08:11,044 --> 00:08:15,162
The config passes the test, the page is served, and the API answers.

215
00:08:15,712 --> 00:08:17,909
The API is answered by the backend.

216
00:08:18,459 --> 00:08:21,232
The backend sees the clean path, slash hello.

217
00:08:21,782 --> 00:08:24,342
The backend sees the customer's Host header.

218
00:08:24,892 --> 00:08:27,900
The backend sees the client address and the protocol.

219
00:08:28,450 --> 00:08:29,752
To pass, all five.

220
